From 73df6e5b968f4a6ae04036c799ebcf0eae1b35e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christian Hewitt <christianshewitt@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 01:08:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 155/210] arm64: dts: meson: g12: index the HDMI codec DAI

hdmi_tx has an I2S and an S/PDIF DAI, so a link must say which one it
uses. Add a sound-dai cell to the node; the boards that bind it already
name the I2S DAI.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5
Signed-off-by: Christian Hewitt <christianshewitt@gmail.com>
